Liverpool FC Analysis Page
Overview & Purpose
Delivers a dedicated breakdown of Liverpool's offensive efficiency, pass precision, age-driven goal contributions, top goal contributors, and defensive duel distribution.

Key Insights
Team Aggregates: Registered 85 total goals from 294 total shots, while maintaining a high 88.15% pass accuracy across 20 Premier League titles context.

Attacking Production: Mohamed Salah dominates team output with 57 goal contributions, significantly leading Cody Gakpo (25) and Luis Díaz (25).

Age Contribution Breakdown: Prime-aged players generate the largest share of team goals and assists (42.36% / 61 G/A), closely complemented by Experienced group members (36.11% / 52 G/A).

Duel Metrics: Defenders won the highest total volume of duels (310 duels out of 743 team duels), led individually by Virgil van Dijk (173 duels) and Ibrahima Konaté (137 duels).
